## Resolution
sanitizeDeclaration() recurses on '&' using the $delimiter parameter that was already declared and never passed, so intersection members are resolved individually and rendered identically to formatReflectionType(). Test: testSanitizeDeclarationResolvesIntersectionMembersIndividually.
